--- a name that is not a setting at all is rejected ---
--- a setting of a different database engine is rejected ---
0
--- a setting of the engine is still accepted in the reset form ---
Atomic SETTINGS max_tables = DEFAULT
--- a query setting is still accepted in the reset form ---
Atomic
--- the second engine that accepts these settings behaves the same ---
Ordinary SETTINGS max_tables = DEFAULT
--- every other engine that accepts settings behaves the same ---
